---
description: Reglas y convenciones para animaciones con Motion en React
globs: **/*.{tsx,jsx}
alwaysApply: true
---

- Always use modern `motion/react` imports.
- Animate only `opacity` and `transform` (scale, x, y).
- Use spring physics: `transition: { type: "spring", stiffness: 300, damping: 25 }`.
- Wrap exits with `<AnimatePresence mode="wait">` and unique keys.
